## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### "Context does not exist"
Run `{{kebabCase name}} setup` to initialize the index.

### "No relevant context found"
Try:
- Refreshing the index: `{{kebabCase name}} refresh`
- Using more specific keywords in your query
- Checking that your project files are in the expected format

### Performance Issues
For large projects (>1000 files), indexing may take several minutes. This only needs to be done once.

